  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the solutions of the equation <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math> is equal to"
